  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAWE (FEMSA, ACAFE, SRP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAWE Program (FEMSA, etc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAWE is a pan-African NGO based in Nairobi. Its goal is to promote education for girls and women at all levels. In this agreement support is given to three programmes: FEMSA to promote education in Mathematics and Sciences; ACAFE support to local NGOs/CBOs involved in promotion of female education. SRP support to strategic planning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAWE &#xe4;r en panafrikansk EO med huvudkontor i Nairobi. &#xd6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja de afrikanska l&#xe4;nderna i arbetet med att fr&#xe4;mja flickors och kvinnors utbildning. I detta avtal ges st&#xf6;d till tre av organisationens program;FEMSA=f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre matematik&amp;NA-utb.,ACAFE st&#xf6;d till lokala EO. SRP st&#xf6;d till planering (se notepad)</narrative>
  </description>
